	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You will be facin’ opponent no. {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0}.\nAre you ready?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to save and\nquit the game?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to cancel your\nBattle Room challenge?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to save the last battle\nas your Battle Video?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s battle has been saved\nas a Battle Video.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There was an error.\nThe Battle Video couldn’t be saved.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Delete your existin’ Battle Video and\nsave the last battle?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saving...\nDon’t turn off the power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congratulations on your streak,\nchallenger!\rThe Frontier Brain sent word. He’s\nIMPRESSED. He’s also LOUD.\rHe see your skill and wanna scrap!\rYou ready to face the Tower Tycoon?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO! My name’s Palmer!\rI heard a LOT about you! You {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\nfrom New Bark Town, RIGHT?!\rYou WAY younger than I thought! My\nson’s around your age! He’s so loud!\rSo show me!\rShow me the bond with your homies!\rShow me what you learned scrappin’!\nLET’S GOOO!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Palmer: So you made it this far AGAIN!\rAs Tower Tycoon, I gotta give it my\nALL!\rThat’s how the best Hustlers show\nrespect!\rBy goin’ ALL OUT as students of homies!\nLET’S GOOO!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BRAVO!\rI bet a LOT of great Hustlers gon’\ncome challenge me like you!\rI’m HYPE for that! SO hype!\rYou gon’ get even better! Keep\nscrappin’ Hustlers from all over\fthe world and keep growin’!\rI’m proud of you! Like a dad!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BRAVO! I feel INSPIRED in my HEART!\rMy young homie, the world and your\nfuture hold INFINITE promise!\rThe spirits of people and homies call to\neach other!\rThe bond is INFINITELY strong! Go on,\nbe everythin’ you wanna be!\rNO LIMITS! *cries manly tears*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You cleared your SEVENTH match!\nCongrats!\rTo honor your talent, here’s BP!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CONGRATULATIONS!\rYou beat the Tower Tycoon! He’s\ncryin’! Happy tears! Mostly!\rTo honor your talent, here’s BP!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0} BP!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0097_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saving...\nDon’t turn off the power.</language>
	</row>
</body>
